#X obj 652 11 fx.greyhole~;
#X obj 205 78 cnv 1 560 136 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -257983 -1 0;
#X text 215 83 A complex echo-like effect \, inspired by the classic
Eventide effect of a similar name. The effect consists of a diffuser
(like a mini-reverb \, structurally similar to the one used in JPverb)
connected in a feedback system with a long \, modulated delay-line.
Excels at producing spacey washes of sound.;
#X text 215 184 Developed as part of the DEIND project.;
#X msg 50 262 1000 1000 0 \, 300 300 1000 \, 3000 500 1300 \, 0 100 1400;
#X obj 50 291 vline~;
#X obj 50 320 osc.saw~;
#X obj 50 349 fx.greyhole~;
#X obj 213 349 ui.hsl;
#X obj 50 392 *~;
#X obj 126 392 *~;
#X obj 50 435 dac~;
#X obj 20 485 cnv 1 745 1 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -203890 -1 0;
